  "body": "In the Push Gateway API https://matrix.org/docs/spec/push_gateway/r0.1.0.html is already a room_name field which makes it easy for app developers to show the correct room name. Even rooms without a name are correctly calculated with the names of the users in the room. (e.g. Alice and Bob)\r\n\r\nCan we have the same with \"avatar_url\"? For my app FluffyChat it would make things much easier. On Ubuntu Touch the part of the app which handles the push notifications is independent from the rest of the app.",
